     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "כי הא דרבה בר רב הונא מחתך ליה אתלת קרנתא",
     "supports": "p_simana_matir",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_rav_heichi_achal",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "אלא רב, היכי אכל בישרא? -- if hidden meat is forbidden, how did Rav eat meat?",
     "against": "p_rav_nitalem_asur",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "a_beshaateih",
     "gloss_en": "בשעתיה, דלא מעלים עיניה מיניה -- at once, not taking his eye off it",
     "answers": "obj_rav_heichi_achal",
     "restores": "p_rav_nitalem_asur"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "a_tzayra_vachatima",
     "gloss_en": "איבעית אימא: בצירא וחתימא -- tied and sealed",
     "answers": "obj_rav_heichi_achal",
     "restores": "p_rav_nitalem_asur"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "a_besimana",
     "gloss_en": "ואי נמי: בסימנא, כי הא דרבה בר רב הונא מחתך ליה אתלת קרנתא (= p_simana_matir)",
     "answers": "obj_rav_heichi_achal",
     "restores": "p_rav_nitalem_asur"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_rbrh_tlat_karnata",
     "gloss_en": "Rabba bar Rav Huna would cut it into three-cornered pieces"
    }
   ]
  },
